{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261115/photo/bkn-20261115041017070-1115_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261115052750\"/><p>遇襲男子送院救治。</p><p>灣仔發生傷人案。今日(15日)凌晨3時44分，一名男子報案，指其男友人在皇后大道中29號遇襲受傷。救援人員到場發現事主面部被𠝹傷，經初步治理傷勢後，送往瑪麗醫院救治。警員正調查事件起因，並追緝兇徒歸案。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T21:51:16.587025+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T20:10:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T21:44:38.939254+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T21:44:38.939254+00:00","content_hash":"ff42bfedd71a3b2d556a095cd77522ed5dff1dbfcd24a905929a88385d76baf6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}